  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency School Construction and Rehabilitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The revised objective of the project is to improve conditions of learning of students in primary and scondary schools in Iraq through the construction of new schools, the extension of existing schools, and the rehabilitation of schools in need of urgent repair.</narrative>
  </description>
